---
const { whatsapp } = Astro.props;
---

<section id="contacto" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-ink py-20 lg:py-32">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 dot-matrix opacity-10"></div>
  <div class="absolute -right-24 -top-24 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-ember-500/20 blur-[100px]"></div>
  <div class="absolute -left-24 -bottom-24 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-cobalt-500/20 blur-[100px]"></div>
  
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow text-ember-300">Impulsa tu negocio</span>
        <h2 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl leading-[1.1]">
          NO SE TRATA DE ESTAR, SE TRATA DE <span class="text-ember-500">DESTACAR.</span> 
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-8 text-lg text-white/60 leading-8 max-w-xl">
          ¿Listo para automatizar procesos y vender más? Cuéntanos tu idea y te ayudaremos a convertirla en una herramienta real.
        </p>
        
        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <a href={whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-ember-500 text-white font-extrabold text-sm shadow-xl shadow-ember-500/20 hover:bg-ember-600 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1">
            Cotizar por WhatsApp
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 2L11 13M22 2l-7 20-4-9-9-4 20-7z"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#proyectos" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl border-2 border-white/10 text-white font-extrabold text-sm hover:bg-white/5 transition-all">
            Ver proyectos reales
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="reveal relative lg:ml-auto">
        <div class="relative rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-2xl">
          <img 
            src="https://framerusercontent.com/images/dashboard-dark.png" 
            alt="Dashboard Preview" 
            class="rounded-2xl w-full h-auto shadow-2xl"
          />
        </div>
        <!-- Stats Float -->
        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 p-6 shadow-2xl hidden sm:block">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white/40 uppercase tracking-widest">Crecimiento Promedio</div>
                <div class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white">+42% anual</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
